<title>USA: ABM Industries names new controller.</title>
<headline>ABM Industries names new controller.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABM Industries Inc said Friday it has appointed Vernon Skelton as controller and chief accounting officer.</p>
<p>The company said its former controller, Hussain Khan, will continue as assistant vice president and director of internal audit.</p>
<p>Before his promotion, Skelton was assistant vice president and director of accounting.</p>
<p>ABM is a facility services contractor with almost 50,000 employees and revenues of more than $1 billion.</p>
</text>
